   "stem_html": "  <ol class=\"os-raise-noindent\">\n    <li>Enter the given data into Desmos, then calculate the regression approximation to determine the curve of best fit.       <table class=\"unnumbered\">\n        <thead>\n          <tr>\n            <th scope=\"col\"><span data-math=\"x_1\">x_1</span></th>\n            <th scope=\"col\"><span data-math=\"y_1\">y_1</span></th>\n          </tr>\n        </thead>\n        <tbody>\n          <tr>\n            <td>2</td>\n            <td>56</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td>5</td>\n            <td>116</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td>8</td>\n            <td>155</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td>11</td>\n            <td>205</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td>17</td>\n            <td>230</td>\n          </tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n    </li>\n  </ol>\n  <p>What is the equation for the curve of best fit that models the data?</p>",
